 proxygen  coro testing proxygen  coro  test   
 
test windowcontainertest  belowkminthreshold uint32 t kcapacity   64   1024  
  windowcontainer container kcapacity   
  expect container reserve kcapacity  0    
  expect eq container processed  kcapacity   2  - 1   0   
  expect gt container processed 1   0   
  
 
test windowcontainertest  abovekminthreshold uint32 t kcapacity   1024   1024 uint32 t kminthreshold   128   1024  
  windowcontainer container kcapacity   
  expect container reserve kcapacity  0    
  expect eq container processed kminthreshold - 1   0   
  expect gt container processed 1   0   
  
 
     proxygen lib http coro test windowcontainertests